# The farm drone's script. It runs one shift after every delve.
# Every line takes one tick. The field is 6 wide and 4 tall.
plant(Wheat)     # sow wheat on this tile
move(East)
plant(Wheat)
move(East)
plant(Wheat)
wait(7)          # wheat is ripe after 8 ticks
harvest()        # 1 wheat
move(West)
harvest()
move(West)
harvest()
# Six tiles and four rows, and all this time to fill them. With a loop the drone
# could sweep the whole field. Try pumpkins too: patches of them pay much more.
